Variable,Purpose,Notes
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL,Project URL,Safe for browser
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY,Publishable / anon key,Preferred name in current Supabase docs
